        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Scott Grimes, Donald Malarkey, Matthew Leitch, Steve Smith\n- Works: ER, Party of Five, Band of Brothers, American Dad!\n- Roles: Dr. Archie Morris, Will McCorkle, Technical Sergeant Donald Malarkey, Floyd Talbert\n\nFacts:\n- Scott Grimes appeared in Party of Five as Will McCorkle.\n- Scott Grimes portrayed Technical Sergeant Donald Malarkey in the HBO miniseries Band of Brothers.\n- Donald Malarkey was portrayed by Scott Grimes in the HBO miniseries Band of Brothers.\n- Matthew Leitch, born on 19 March 1975, is an English actor best known for portraying Floyd Talbert in the award-winning HBO miniseries Band of Brothers.\n- Scott Grimes appeared in ER as Dr. Archie Morris.\n- Scott Grimes voiced Steve Smith in the animated sitcom American Dad!",
